 class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/PersistentHashMap.html#Lean.PHashMap\">Lean.PHashMap</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/ExprPtr.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.ExprPtr\">Lean.Meta.Sym.ExprPtr</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></span> →\n            <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.SemiringState\">Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.SemiringState</a></span> →\n              <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/PersistentHashMap.html#Lean.PHashMap\">Lean.PHashMap</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/ExprPtr.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.ExprPtr\">Lean.Meta.Sym.ExprPtr</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a> → <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.State\">Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.State</a></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.State.mk","kind":"ctor","line":217,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.State.mk","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.lean#L217-L251"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">structure</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.State\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">CommRing</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Per-goal state of the ring solver.\n\nThe four arrays are indexed by the ids assigned by `Sym.Arith.classify?`: `rings[i]` is the\nsolver state for `Sym.Arith.State.rings[i]`, and likewise for `semirings`, `ncRings`, and\n`ncSemirings`. The `Sym.Arith` arrays are shared by every goal of the run and only grow, while\na goal uses only some of the rings. To keep the two indexings aligned, an array here is padded\nwith empty states up to the id being written (see `State.modifyRing`), and reading an id beyond\nthe array returns the empty state. Rings a goal never used therefore cost at most an empty\nentry, and `rings.size ≤ Sym.Arith.State.rings.size` always holds.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.State","kind":"structure","line":217,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.State","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.lean#L217-L251"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.instInhabitedCommRingState\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">CommRing</span>.<span class=\"name\">instInhabitedCommRingState</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Inhabited\">Inhabited</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.CommRingState\">CommRingState</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/CommRing/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.CommRing.instInhabitedCommRingState"